node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.local
.cache/
# Generated sites nest one level deeper than the original rules assumed
# (sites/<host>/site/.next), so these must be recursive.
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
# Mirrored copies of a source site's own CSS/JS/images. Generated artefacts of a demo
# run against sites we do not own — regenerate with `underpin build`, don't commit them.
sites/*/site/public/assets/
sites/*/site/public/media/
sites/*/site/content/pages/
# One demo site is committed as a worked example. Every other capture is of a site we do
# not own — regenerate them with `underpin build`, don't ship someone else's markup.
sites/*
!sites/demos.kadencewp.com/
# Screenshot diffs and a lockfile for the generated app: both regenerate, and the diffs are
# images of somebody else's website.
sites/*/_migration/diffs/
sites/*/site/package-lock.json
.underpin/
.shots/
